 🎬 Flashback: Axios House at Climate Week &amp; UNGA 2025 
 
Axios co-founder Mike Allen and White House National Energy Dominance Council executive director Jarrod Agen on stage at Axios House Climate Week and UNGA. Photo : Sam Popp for Axios

 
 Catch up quick: &nbsp; Last year, Axios House convened over 1300 industry leaders for newsworthy conversations on shaping the global agenda and influencing climate action.&nbsp;

 
 Featured speakers included Gap Inc. chief communications officer Mame Annan-Brown , Ecolab chairman and CEO Christophe Beck , Delta Air Lines chief sustainability officer Amelia DeLuca , Patagonia CEO Ryan Gellert , Amazon chief sustainability officer Kara Hurst , TerraPower president and CEO Chris Levesque , Sen. Jeanne Shaheen (D-N.H.), Sen. Sheldon Whitehouse (D-R.I.), McLaren Racing director of sustainability Kim Wilson and many more.&nbsp; 
